WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:03.663
For buttons and in-depth control, use apiRef.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.316
apiRef hands you the player itself.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.100
With no other prop, nothing plays until you say so.

4
00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:32.375
Then every command is a plain call: play, pause, back to the start, and the speed, even backwards.

5
00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:14.506
apiRef works in every mode, next to autoplay or the props, and never changes which one is in charge.
